<title>ANGOLA: PRESS DIGEST - Angola - March 19.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Angola - March 19.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Angolan press on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>JORNAL DE ANGOLA</p>
<p>- Cabinda environmental group ABC Gremio has appealed to U.S.-based Chevron to show greater sensitivity on ecological matters in the oil-rich enclave.</p>
<p>- A Catholic-funded radio station, which closed soon after the outbreak of civil war in 1977, will go on the air in Angola on Thursday.</p>
</text>
